Third-party material

The desktop suite's PDF view (#2245) draws, reads and searches PDF pages
with the following crates and the data they embed. Each is used under its
own licence; the crates' licence texts are in their sources, at the revisions
suite/Cargo.toml and suite/Cargo.lock pin.

- PdfCraft (pdfcraft-render, pdfcraft-cos, pdfcraft-fonts, pdfcraft-geom),
  https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft
  Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the PdfCraft contributors.
  MIT OR Apache-2.0.

- craft-libs (craft-pdf, craft-stream-codecs, hayro-postscript, and its
  own copy of hayro-jbig2 0.3.0 that craft-stream-codecs uses),
  https://github.com/storytold/craft-libs
  Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the craft-libs contributors;
  hayro-jbig2 Copyright (c) The Hayro Authors.
  MIT OR Apache-2.0.

- hayro (hayro, hayro-interpret, hayro-syntax, hayro-cmap, hayro-jbig2),
  https://github.com/LaurenzV/hayro, in PdfCraft's patched copies; and
  hayro-ccitt 0.3.0 and hayro-jpeg2000 0.3.5, the crates.io releases.
  Copyright (c) The Hayro Authors. MIT OR Apache-2.0.

- Vello (vello_cpu, vello_common 0.0.8), https://github.com/linebender/vello,
  in PdfCraft's patched copies; and vello_common 0.0.9, the crates.io
  release. Copyright 2020 the Vello Authors.
  MIT OR Apache-2.0.

- lopdf, https://github.com/J-F-Liu/lopdf, in PdfCraft's patched copy.
  MIT.

Data embedded by those crates:

- The PDF standard fonts hayro-interpret substitutes for the base-14 fonts
  (vendor/hayro-interpret/assets/*.pfb), extracted from PDFium:
  Copyright 2014 PDFium Authors. All rights reserved. Original code
  copyright 2014 Foxit Software Inc. http://www.foxitsoftware.com
  Use is governed by a BSD-style licence (PDFium's LICENSE file).

- Adobe's character maps (hayro-cmap, assets/cmaps.brotli):
  Copyright 1990-2023 Adobe. All rights reserved. BSD-3-Clause
  (hayro-cmap's assets/LICENSE.txt).

- The CMYK ICC profile CGATS001Compat-v2-micro.icc (hayro-interpret), from
  https://github.com/saucecontrol/Compact-ICC-Profiles: CC0-1.0.

pdfcraft-fonts also carries the Inter and Dancing Script typefaces (SIL Open
Font License 1.1); the suite does not use the code that embeds them, and its
release build does not contain them.
